Package: stowaway
Version: 2.2
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: git, golang
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/ph4ntonn/Stowaway
Description: Multi-hop proxy tool for security researchers and pentesters
 Stowaway builds a chained proxy through multiple compromised hosts,
 supporting a node-based topology with SOCKS5/HTTP proxying, file
 transfers, password-protected handshakes and pluggable upstream/
 downstream protocols. Includes both the admin console and agent
 binaries (stowaway-admin, stowaway-agent).
